26347","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"mal","id":"44067","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"101099","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"381536","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[5]}],"link":"79121","synopsis":"在百姓的崇拜中迷失自我，空明真人无止尽地向小白索要蛇丹，最终导致小白元神受损而失控; 死而复生的小白再次出现，那被杀掉的蛇妖又是谁呢？","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/vIvWkTD6E4TCueaEgSyJ9yNk7yV.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 6","episodeNumber":6,"sourceEpisodeNumber":6,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"15967","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"126347","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"mal","id":"44067","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"101099","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"381536","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[6]}],"link":"79122","synopsis":"为保护心爱之人，觉悔走了极端，但对方临死前的一句话，却成了他的心魔，觉悔为参悟强者的真谛，愿自断蛇尾在鹿门寺礼佛。 千年前的觉悔是被视为不祥之物的化蛇，而如今他法号里不变的「悔」字又源自何故？","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/522xeWWJcDRYoOLEEoiRRZ2sB9J.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 7","episodeNumber":7,"sourceEpisodeNumber":7,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"15967","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"126347","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"mal","id":"44067","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"101099","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"381536","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[7]}],"link":"79123","synopsis":"神秘人掳走磨牙，竟是要他去成亲。 为救磨牙，桃夭和柳公子来到天水镇，在镇上闲逛时，桃夭察觉出空气里弥漫的是带雄黄的香料，进入饭馆天仙楼，撞破了天仙楼老板的秘密勾当，老板夫妇受威胁买卖重病之人，却认为这是你情我愿、皆大欢喜之事......","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/sEtXCw1nUkP3jmQf2mAQbUtrbtL.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 8","episodeNumber":8,"sourceEpisodeNumber":8,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"15967","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"126347","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"mal","id":"44067","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"101099","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"381536","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[8]}],"link":"79124","synopsis":"得知磨牙去向后，桃夭与柳公子装病混入温府，面对满车奄奄一息又心如死灰的病者，桃夭不禁陷入沉思。 桃夭和柳公子混入温府之中，准备伺机将其救出，桃夭识破温夫人身份「媼」，食亡者，能断人死时，得人形者皆为貌美之女，称媼姬。 媼姬宁愿付出生命的代价，也不愿说出磨牙的位置，而另一边，磨牙则遇到了温家小姐山海......","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/oEb0y0IN50XA1ohoWYVATEcLklN.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 9","episodeNumber":9,"sourceEpisodeNumber":9,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"15967","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"126347","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"mal","id":"44067","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"101099","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"381536","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[9]}],"link":"79125","synopsis":"磨牙与山海进入到幻境之中，面对似曾相识的场景，山海突然唤起昔日恋人的名字若麟。 若麟赠予山海定情信物相约私奔，温夫人究竟对山海说了什么，使其最终放弃了赴约呢？ 山海得知若麟只剩半年寿命后，仍选择继续和他在一起，但是与母亲同为媼姬的山海注定无法与若麟长相厮守......","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/yzgk28s6tIyo8aRNkqmzdzGTzEY.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 10","episodeNumber":10,"sourceEpisodeNumber":10,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"15967","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"126347","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"mal","id":"44067","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"101099","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"381536","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[10]}],"link":"79126","synopsis":"磨牙说桃夭是个刀子嘴豆腐心的人，表面上谁都不在乎，但其实是个很怕寂寞的人，即便两人日常打闹拌嘴，但磨牙依然坚信桃夭会来救自己。 山海求生的欲望越是低迷，怪物的力量就越强大。 磨牙一次又一次地呼唤山海的名字，试图将其从迷境中唤醒，山海最终无法逃脱被怪物吞噬的命运，得知女儿已死的温夫人因急火攻心而陷入了昏迷，山海的性命是否还有挽回的余地？","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/z19o8PVnp6OeFeocEYGyCFKM9Fv.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 11","episodeNumber":11,"sourceEpisodeNumber":11,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"15967","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"126347","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"mal","id":"44067","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"101099","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"381536","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[11]}],"link":"79127","synopsis":"惊蛰从众人手中救下伤痕累累的媼姬，身为术士的他究竟是善是恶？ 他与媼姬之间又发生了什么事呢？ 不可思议！ 原本应针锋相对的媼姬与术士居然当上了邻居，甚至结为了夫妇？ 惊蛰虽到死都深爱着媼姬，却以人妖殊途的理由劝媼姬离开自己。 这个男人是我的救命恩人，是我此生挚爱的夫君，却也是亲手将我推进地狱的人。","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/wRj9PF3f2PzH6YkNHBLdClVjVjH.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 12","episodeNumber":12,"sourceEpisodeNumber":12,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"15967","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"126347","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"mal","id":"44067","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"101099","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"381536","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[12]}],"link":"79128","synopsis":"媼姬口中绝情的丈夫惊蛰，其实从未离开妻女的身边。 秦管家真身乃照海，面部为一块明镜的妖怪，照海跟随了惊蛰22年，目睹了媼姬与惊蛰之间发生的一切，照海化身秦姓男子，救下遭遇劫匪的媼姬与山海，终于等到了留在她们身边的机会。 照海最终选择用自己一生仅一次的能力，换取山海的重生，时光倒流，重归于初，山海这一次，要做一个幸福的姑娘，管它是妖怪还是人类。","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/wC8eeQ93Fm8GZtMIunyI3A2ejcY.jpg"}],"sourceIds":{"anilistId":126347,"malId":44067},"mappings":{"source":"anibridge-v3","schemaVersion":"3.0.3","generatedOn":"2026-10-29T07:54:59Z","sourceDescriptors":["anilist:126347","mal:44067"],"targets":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"15967","scope":"R","ranges":{"1-12":"1-12"}},{"provider":"anilist","id":"126347","ranges":{"1-12":"1-12"}},{"provider":"mal","id":"44067","ranges":{"1-12":"1-12"}},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"101099","scope":"s2","ranges":{"1-12":"1-12"}},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"381536","scope":"s2","ranges":{"1-12":"1-12"}}]},"sourceMetadata":